84 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 31 0 R
/E (VALORA is a Private Property Website and Community Management System that aims to combine the listing and viewing of properties within a specific housing complex/private gated community, whilst also giving the residents a private digital platform to voice their concerns. On the property side, for the buyers, investors and real estate agents, VALORA provides AI valuation, growth score, rental yield, as well as a 10-year ROI. On the community living side, relating to the homeowners and residents, VALORA provides a complaint tracker, service provider directory and HOAs. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [42]
>>
endobj
85 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 31 0 R
/E (VALORA, helps to solve a genuine, documented problem in the South African property and community management landscape. It simplifies access to property intelligence whilst also giving the residents a functional, transparent system to improve their life within the housing complexes/private gated communities.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [43]
>>
endobj
