88 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 31 0 R
/E (In South Africa, property buyers and investors face a significant information gap, specifically in housing complexes/private gated communities. Currently, we have platforms like Property24 and Private Property show listings, however these platforms barely provide insight on whether there is potential growth for the area, if the pricing on the property is fair, or what return value an investor can expect. There is also the issue of these housing complexes/private gated communities lacking a unified system to report complaints or disturbances, find trusted local service providers or to track the status of living issues affecting their daily lives within the property.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [46]
>>
endobj
