/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 33 0 R
/E (The project will be developed using an Agile SDLC with the Scrum framework. The team selected this approach because it enables them to adapt their AI development work through continuous user feedback which helps maintain product market relevance. The project schedule includes 14 bi-weekly sprints, which begin with foundational setup work for authentication and then progress to complex AI features that include valuation and investment metrics, before finishing with security audits and a pilot launch. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
